[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0459","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0459.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0574","title":"OpenBSD ftpd 等 FTP 服务器 setproctitle 格式化字符串漏洞","description":"OpenBSD ftpd、NetBSD ftpd、ProFTPd 及 Opieftpd 等 FTP 服务器在调用 setproctitle（又称 set_proc_title）函数时，未能正确过滤不可信格式字符串，存在格式化字符串漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务器发送特制的包含格式化字符串占位符（如 %n、%s）的请求，利用该漏洞触发内存越界读写，导致服务崩溃拒绝服务或在目标系统上执行任意命令。攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可发起，影响范围广泛。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0574"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01Z","remediation":"升级 OpenBSD ftpd 至 2.7 及以上版本，NetBSD ftpd 应用 NetBSD-SA2000-009 安全公告中的补丁，ProFTPd 升级至 1.2.0rc2 及以上版本，Opieftpd 安装厂商提供的格式字符串修复补丁。如无法立即升级，可在 inetd 配置中禁用匿名 FTP 访问并限制可登录用户范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0031.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0061.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0121.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-13.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1425","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1438","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/396","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0574.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0574","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0574.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0574.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-8prx-m86f-2h6h/GHSA-8prx-m86f-2h6h.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ftp_setproctitle.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0574.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--806c661a-ead4-4e4c-aacd-e3dc401974eb.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0459.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0458","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0458.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0573","title":"WU-FTPD wu-ftpd 远程格式字符串漏洞","description":"wu-ftpd 2.6.0 及更早版本中的 lreply 函数存在格式化字符串漏洞，该函数未能正确清理不可信格式化字符串参数，导致远程攻击者可通过 SITE EXEC 命令向目标 FTP 服务器发送特制的格式化字符串载荷触发该漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞实现远程代码执行，获取服务器的完全控制权。该漏洞影响所有运行 wu-ftpd 2.6.0 及之前版本的系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前已存在公开的利用代码，通过构造包含格式化字符串的 SITE EXEC 参数即可触发栈覆盖，实现任意代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0573"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01Z","remediation":"立即升级 wu-ftpd 至 2.6.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 lreply 函数中格式字符串处理不当的问题。如无法升级，在 ftpaccess 配置文件中禁用 SITE EXEC 命令（添加 `deny-uid %siteexec%` 规则），并在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 21 端口的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0244.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0017.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96171893218000&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96179429114160&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96299933720862&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-020.0.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-13.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-039.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1387","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000623091822.3321.qmail%40fiver.freemessage.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4773","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20030","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2000/CVE-2000-0573.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0573.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0573","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2000/CVE-2000-0573/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1971.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0573.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0573.md","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/cve_2_MSF_exploit_Mapping/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/KvasirSecurity/Kvasir/blob/a5b3775184a8343240e1154a1f762f75df04dc0a/static/etc/canvas_exploits.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0458.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0702","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0702.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0595","title":"FreeBSD libedit 本地代码执行漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统自带的 libedit 库在初始化时会在当前工作目录而非用户主目录中查找 .editrc 配置文件，存在本地权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在目标用户可能访问的共享目录（如 /tmp）中放置恶意的 .editrc 文件，当受害者在该目录下执行使用了 libedit 的程序时，恶意配置中的命令将以受害者权限执行，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 系统，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0595"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:04Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 3.5-RELEASE 或 4.0-RELEASE 之后的安全补丁版本，或更新 libedit 库至修复该问题的版本（2000 年 7 月 FreeBSD 安全公告已提供补丁）。临时缓解措施：避免在包含不可信 .editrc 文件的目录中运行 libedit 相关程序（如 ftp、mail 等），或设置环境变量限制当前目录搜索行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-07/0035.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1446","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1437","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0595.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0595","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0595.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0595.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cm4m-9c34-c8p6/GHSA-cm4m-9c34-c8p6.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0595.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0595.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6a253d53-9493-454b-9e15-f7a89696feac.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0702.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0696","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0696.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0591","title":"Novell BorderManager URL过滤绕过漏洞","description":"Novell BorderManager 3.0 及 3.5 版本存在 URL 过滤绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在请求 URL 中对特殊字符进行编码（如 URL 编码），绕过 BorderManager 的 URL 过滤规则，访问本应被拦截的受限资源。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，仅影响系统完整性，不涉及机密性和可用性。受影响的系统包括运行 Novell BorderManager 3.0 和 3.5 的服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0591"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03Z","remediation":"Novell BorderManager 3.0/3.5 已停止技术支持，无官方补丁。建议立即升级至受支持的替代产品（如 Novell Access Manager 或第三方安全网关）。若无法升级，可在代理服务器或防火墙上配置 URL 规范化规则，对 % 编码、双编码及 Unicode 编码的 URL 进行解码后重新检测，同时启用深度包检测（DPI）过滤绕过尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0038.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1432","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0591.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0591","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0591.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0591.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hvq3-qm62-8ff5/GHSA-hvq3-qm62-8ff5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0591.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_bypass.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0696.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0673","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0673.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0576","title":"Oracle Web Listener for AIX 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle Web Listener for AIX 4.0.7.0.0 及 4.0.8.1.0 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送特制的畸形 URL 请求，触发 Web 监听器处理异常，导致服务进程崩溃或资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行在 IBM AIX 系统上的 Oracle Web Listener 服务，攻击者只需能够向目标发送 HTTP 请求即可利用，攻击门槛较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0576"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02Z","remediation":"Oracle Web Listener for AIX 4.0.7.0.0 及 4.0.8.1.0 已停止维护，建议立即迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Oracle HTTP Server 或 IBM HTTP Server）。如无法迁移，可在网络边界防火墙配置规则，过滤包含畸形路径/超长 URL 的入站请求，并限制对 Oracle Web Listener 端口的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0027.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1427","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0576.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0576","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0576.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0576.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rx3c-x33m-733h/GHSA-rx3c-x33m-733h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0576.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/b3f8802d959465aac8f9cdd0806abe7fb52f94b5/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0673.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0671","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0671.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0575","title":"SSH Kerberos认证支持票据缓存嗅探漏洞","description":"SSH 1.2.27 在启用 Kerberos 认证支持时，会将 Kerberos 票据缓存文件创建在登录用户的当前工作目录中，而非安全的临时目录。当用户的家目录挂载在 NFS 网络文件系统上时，远程攻击者可通过嗅探网络流量获取该票据缓存文件，进而窃取用户的 Kerberos 身份凭证，实现未授权访问。该漏洞影响 SSH 1.2.27 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0575"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01Z","remediation":"升级至 SSH 1.2.28 或更高版本（该版本已修复 KRB5CCNAME 环境变量误设为 \"none\" 的问题）。如无法升级，可手动修改 sshd.c 第 4296 行，将 `if (ticket)` 改为 `if (ticket && strcmp(\"none\", ticket))`，避免将 KRB5CCNAME 设为 \"none\"。临时缓解措施：禁用 Kerberos 认证支持（编译时不加 --with-kerberos5），或避免将用户主目录放在 NFS 等网络文件系统上。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96256265914116&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1426","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4903","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0575.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0575","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0575.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0575.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ssh_kerberos.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0575.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0575.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dfd01263-5503-453b-857e-28b5ed8c250a.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ssh_kerberos.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0671.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0457","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0457.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0572","title":"Visible Systems Razor 配置管理工具密码文件弱加密漏洞","description":"Visible Systems Razor 4.1 配置管理工具对其密码文件使用了弱加密算法，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞读取或破解密码文件，从而获取系统更高权限。该漏洞源于密码存储时未采用强加密机制，攻击者只需拥有本地访问权限即可通过分析密码文件实施权限提升攻击。CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0572"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01Z","remediation":"升级 Razor 至 4.1 以上版本，该版本已采用更强的密码加密机制。如无法升级，可在 Razor 配置中切换为本地操作系统认证方式，避免使用 Razor 自带的弱加密密码文件认证。同时限制 rz_passwd 文件的访问权限，仅允许 root 用户读取，防止本地非授权用户获取密码哈希。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1424","http://www.securityfocus.com/