版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。目前厂商已停止维护，建议用户迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0571"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用已停止维护的 West Street LocalWEB HTTP Server 1.2.0，迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）。若无法立即迁移，可在网络防火墙或反向代理层配置规则，拦截长度超过 4096 字节的 HTTP GET 请求路径，以缓解拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1423","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-07-8&msg=NCBBKFKDOLAGKIAPMILPCEIHCFAA.labs%40ussrback.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4896","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20054","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0571.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0571.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0571","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0571.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0571.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0f0b9d6a392d0d58ac48900af57e1d0e8f253633/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-05xx/CVE-2000-0571.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/efeaee5bdc1875affd1d4dced4dd0e858922c00e/2000/CVE-2000-0571.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0571.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0571.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0571.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0455.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0455.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0455.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0469","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0469.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0590","title":"CGI-World Poll It 2.0 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"CGI-World Poll It 2.0 存在内部变量覆盖漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 data_dir 参数传递恶意文件名，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Poll It 2.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前已有公开 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0590"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Poll It 2.0 CGI 脚本，该软件已停止维护且无官方补丁。如必须使用，编辑 Poll_It_SSI_v2.0.cgi 文件，在脚本开头添加 `use CGI qw(:standard);` 并改用 `param()` 函数获取参数，禁止直接使用环境变量或 `QUERY_STRING` 解析用户输入；同时在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置 `RewriteRule ^/cgi-bin/pollit/ - [F]` 拒绝访问该目录作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0076.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1431","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4878","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20059","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0590.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0590","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0590.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0590.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p3qf-8c2m-c92q/GHSA-p3qf-8c2m-c92q.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/9c642