0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0584"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03Z","remediation":"升级 Canna 至 3.2.2 或更高版本（FreeBSD 用户通过 ports 更新并重新编译），或直接卸载 Canna 软件包。如无法升级，创建 /etc/hosts.canna 文件限制仅允许本地主机（localhost/unix）访问，或使用 ipfw/ipf 防火墙限制对 Canna 服务端口的远程访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://shadowpenguin.backsection.net/advisories/advisory038.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1445","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4912","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20061","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0584.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0584","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2000/CVE-2000-0584/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0584.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0584.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-756c-jfq2-c688/GHSA-756c-jfq2-c688.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/canna_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0584.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--760c5c7f-6553-4451-9098-16672c296960.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0464.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0683","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0683.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0583","title":"Inter7 vpopmail vchkpw 格式字符串拒绝服务漏洞","description":"vpopmail 的 vchkpw 组件在 4.8 版本之前存在格式化字符串漏洞，程序在调用 syslog 记录日志时未对用户提供的 USER 或 PASS 命令参数进行正确的格式化字符串过滤，远程攻击者可通过向 SMTP/POP3 服务发送包含特制格式化指令的认证请求触发该漏洞，导致系统日志服务崩溃或产生异常行为，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 vpopmail 4.5 及 4.7 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0583"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02Z","remediation":"升级 vpopmail 至 4.8 或更高版本，该版本已修复 vchkpw 中 syslog 调用的格式化字符串漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 vchkpw 源码中将对 syslog 的调用改为 syslog(LOG_INFO, \"%s\", buffer) 形式，避免直接将用户输入作为格式化字符串参数传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1418","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=395BD2A8.5D3396A7%40secureaustin.com","http://www.vpopmail.cx/vpopmail-ChangeLog","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0583.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0583","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0583.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0583.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2ffp-463q-9cmj/GHSA-2ffp-463q-9cmj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0583.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0583.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/vpop_input_validation.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0683.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0662","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0662.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0568","title":"Sybergen Secure Desktop 2.1 ICMP 路由器通告欺骗漏洞","description":"Sybergen Secure Desktop 2.1 未能正确防护伪造的路由器通告（ICMP 类型 9）报文，远程攻击者可通过发送特制的虚假 ICMP 路由器通告数据包，诱使目标系统修改默认路由表，导致网络流量被重定向至攻击者控制的路径，造成信息泄露或中间人攻击。该漏洞影响 Sybergen Secure Desktop 2.1 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0568"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00Z","remediation":"Sybergen Secure Desktop 2.1 已停止维护且厂商不再存在，无官方补丁可用。建议在网络边界防火墙上配置 ACL 规则，丢弃入站 ICMP 类型 9（路由器通告）报文，防止未授权路由篡改。同时建议迁移至仍在维护的替代安全桌面产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1417","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=4125690E.00524395.00%40guardianit.se","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0568.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0568","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c144cc7f0a439e059cbec31e55f668a8db4215cb/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0568.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0568.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9c8x-vv79-pccg/GHSA-9c8x-vv79-pccg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0568.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/b3f8802d959465aac8f9cdd0806abe7fb52f94b5/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0568.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0662.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0463","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0463.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0582","title":"Check Point FireWall-1 SMTP Security Server 代理 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Check Point FireWall-1 4.0 及 4.1 版本的 SMTP Security Server 代理组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向目标系统的 SMTP 代理发送大量无效命令（如二进制零字节流），导致 SMTP Security Server 资源耗尽而崩溃，从而中断正常的邮件服务。该漏洞影响 Check Point FireWall-1 4.0 和 4.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前已有公开的利用代码，攻击者可通过 ExploitDB 获取 PoC 实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0582"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Check Point FireWall-1 4.0/4.1，官方已不再提供补丁。建议立即升级到受支持的 FireWall-1/GAiA 版本（如 R80.40 及以上）；如无法升级，可在防火墙上限制仅允许可信源 IP 访问 SMTP Security Server 代理端口（默认 25），并配置 SMTP 代理的访问控制规则以丢弃异常流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#SMTP_Security","http://www.osvdb.org/1438","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1416","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.3.96.1000630162106.4619C-100000%40fjord.fscinternet.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20049","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ce